  "lyrics": "1. Fluttering wings, high, low, butterfly finds flow'rs!",
  "notes": [
   "Curriculum song (Prep A, prep-a.bass-d). Original music and words for this app. The words are a butterfly finding pretty flowers (at the parent's request, Oct 7, 2026), for the vocal. \"But-ter-fly\" first came out garbled in nearly every take (\"brother fly\", \"bold up life\"), so it moved to the second phrase (Oct 20, 2026). It ends on \"flow'rs\", one beat: \"blooms\" was sung \"blues\" in most takes."
  ],
